                            "children": [
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": "Array of resource loaders to be invoked after a locale change."
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": "Each loader must be a function which accepts an object and returns either the resource when\n"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "inlineCode",
                                "value": "options.sync"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": " is "
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "inlineCode",
                                "value": "true"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": " or a "
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "inlineCode",
                                "value": "Promise"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": " for the resource when "
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "inlineCode",
                                "value": "options.sync"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": " is "
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "inlineCode",
                                "value": "false"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": "."
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "code",
                            "lang": null,
                            "meta": null,
                            "value": "resources: [\n  (options) => new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    fetchResource({onLoad: resolve, onError: reject});\n  })\n]"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": "If you need to handle the resource in some way on load, you can pass an object with an\n"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "inlineCode",
                                "value": "onLoad"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": " member that will be called once all resources have been loaded. This should be used\nif loading a resource has side effects that should only be applied once all loading has\ncompleted."
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "code",
                            "lang": null,
                            "meta": null,
                            "value": "resources: [\n  {resource: (options) => { ... fetch ... }, onLoad: (res) => { ... apply side effect ... }}\n]"
                          }
                        ]
